# Options for a UML guest that tests the VDUSE virtio-blk backend without
# the sandbox, serving a ubd disk backed by a host file, whose data outlives
# the guest so that the tests of reconnection can check it. Merge on top of
# x86_64_defconfig, driver-guest.config and blk-test.config with
# scripts/kconfig/merge_config.sh. The sandbox refuses a guest with ubd.

CONFIG_BLK_DEV_UBD=y
